    "overview": "New Favourite ICS-A440E-B4H Intelligent EV Charger Key Points Delivers 2×22 kW AC charging (44 kW total), enabling two EVs to charge simultaneously. OCPP 1.6J compliant, ensuring seamless integration with third-party charging management platforms. Compact and elegant design recognized by the 2026 Red Dot Design Award and the French Design Award (FDA). IP55 ingress protection and IK10 impact resistance (IK08 for the display and socket). C5 anti-corrosion protection, featuring highly corrosion-resistant composite materials and protective coatings. Equipped with a 7-inch LCD touchscreen and two physical buttons. Ensures reliable operation even while wearing gloves or in cold-weather conditions. Supports dynamic load balancing across multiple chargers. Equipped with PAX POS machine by default. Sales Enquiry Datasheet",
